  "description": "Azure Blob Storage IDistributedCache for Orleans.Lattice. Backs the ASP.NET Core distributed-cache abstraction with an Azure Storage account (one block blob per entry, expiry tracked in blob metadata, sliding-window support), so a multi-replica web head - for example a hosted Explorer console using Microsoft.Identity.Web token caches - has a shared, off-cluster cache without needing Redis or SQL. Selectable purely by DI.",
